					<description><![CDATA[久违的二次创作 —— 远景Q娃 Cure V1sta! 大家久等了！今天带来的是Q娃化的 V1sta 远景娘— &#8230; <a href="https://v1sta.xyz/artworks/precure-nagisa-v1sta/" class="more-link">继续阅读<span class="screen-reader-text">远景的Q娃Cosplay立绘</span> <span class="meta-nav">&#8594;</span></a>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><a href="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta.jpg" data-lbwps-width="1200" data-lbwps-height="1200" data-lbwps-srcsmall="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta.jpg"><img data-dominant-color="dfe1e1" data-has-transparency="false" style="--dominant-color: #dfe1e1;" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta-1024x1024.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-8321 not-transparent" srcset="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta-150x150.jpg 150w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta-300x300.jpg 300w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta-768x768.jpg 768w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/nagisa-v1sta.jpg 1200w" /></a></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>久违的二次创作 —— 远景Q娃 Cure V1sta! </strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">大家久等了！今天带来的是Q娃化的 V1sta 远景娘——极光天使！<br>是模仿了初代光之美少女的美墨渚/黑天使Cure Black为原型的Cosplay立绘创作。我一直想画这个！<br>今天有时间在Drawpile试着画了初代双人组练手，<br>也要感谢两位伙伴（稍后的文章会提及到）</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">我使用了水彩的上色方式。<br>裙子的部分也是Frutiger Aero风格的极光壁纸纹理。<br>虽然这一版远景娘的设计其实参考了Meiko和初音未来，但是一想到渚的动作和英气也是意料之内地合适啊……于是有了这个想法。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><a href="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future.jpg" data-lbwps-width="2560" data-lbwps-height="1600" data-lbwps-srcsmall="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future.jpg"><img data-dominant-color="45c1cd" data-has-transparency="false" style="--dominant-color: #45c1cd;" decoding="async" width="1024" height="640" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future-1024x640.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-8323 not-transparent" srcset="https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future-1024x640.jpg 1024w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future-300x188.jpg 300w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future-768x480.jpg 768w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future-1536x960.jpg 1536w, https://v1sta.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Cure-V1sta-Digital-Future-2048x1280.jpg 2048w" /></a></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">另外附上一则特制的艺术风格的角色海报壁纸，也是基于先前制作的壁纸系列。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">我要抽时间投稿到Frutiger Aero Archive和StyleStar上……</p>

<p><a href="https://v1sta.xyz/artworks/precure-nagisa-v1sta/" rel="nofollow">来源</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
					
